    "chunk_text": "hete, \u00fea ges\u00e6t & he \u00fea \u00fewoh his handa & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Iudeum: Wita\u00fe ge nu \u00fe\u00e6t ic wille beon \u00feyses mannes blodes \u00dea cw\u00e6don hie, \u00fea Iudeas: Sanguis eius, Sie his blod ofer us & ofer ure bearn. B\u00e6don swi\u00f0e unl\u00e6dlicre bene, swa him sy\u00fe\u00fean eall unl\u00e6dlic on becwom. W\u00e6s \u00feis eall geworden on hira Eastertide. Weor\u00f0edon hie \u00fea tiid swi\u00f0e. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, Pilatus, to Iudeum: Ecce rex uester, \u00feis is eower cyning. Ac hu willa\u00fe ge hine ateon? \u00dea cw\u00e6don hie ealle: Tolle, tolle, crucifige eum, Nim \u00feu hine, nim & hat hine niman, & hat hine ahon. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, Pilatus: Hw\u00e6t, ic \u00feonne hate eowerne cyning ahon? \u00dea cw\u00e6don hie, Iudeas: Ne habba\u00fe we \u00e6nigne cyning butan Casere. \u00dea w\u00e6s \u00e6fter \u00feam wordum \u00fe\u00e6t he, Pilatus, urne dryhten Crist Iudeum agef, & sealde his agene men \u00dea namon hie hine & l\u00e6ddon to \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00fe\u00e6r hie hine eft on ahengon. & he sylfa b\u00e6r \u00fea rode sumne d\u00e6l \u00fe\u00e6s weges \u00fee hine man eft on aheng. \u00dea \u00e6fter \u00feam ahengon hie hine on \u00feam clife \u00fee hie heton Golgo\u00f0\u00f0a, & twegen scea\u00f0an him on \u00fea twa \u00dea wrat he, Pilatus, sum gewrit on brede, & \u00fe\u00e6t het gef\u00e6stnian onufan \u00fea Cristes rode. W\u00e6s \u00f0us awriten: Ies",
